[A Rogue][OC]==PAY ATTENTION TO THE UPCOMING SECTION== \\ Press Escape, then go into -> Options -> Controls \\ Check "Enable Interact Key" and bind the "Interact with Target" option to a key \\ Additionally, it's recommended you enable Enemy Nameplates (Default Key: V) as it allows you to see enemies behind some of the corners inside the tower
